<title>USA: SMT Health Services Q4 Dec 31 full results.</title>
<headline>SMT Health Services Q4 Dec 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Three Months Ended  For the 12 Months Ended</p>
<p>			     Dec. 31,		   Dec. 31,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total Revenues $5,606,000 $3,753,000 $19,212,000 $15,158,000/a</p>
<p>Operating</p>
<p>  Expenses	 1,802,000  1,215,000   6,280,000   5,396,000</p>
